#: ../../source/2-how_to/7-synthetic_data/2-orchestration.md:44
#: 18c2d73f48884bed9bf8740232970ea2
msgid ""
"Datagen workspace used in the README is **`examples/IsaacSim`** inside "
"lerobot_ros2 (contains `robots/`). Robot-specific notes, including "
"wheeled-arm **FiveAges W2** dual-arm tasks, are next to those trees (e.g."
" [`robots/FiveAges_W2/README.md`](https://github.com/fiveages-"
"sim/lerobot_ros2/blob/main/examples/IsaacSim/robots/FiveAges_W2/README.md))."
" A [fa-project-usd](https://github.com/fiveages-sim/fa-project-usd) "
"project directory can be the workspace instead (`LEROBOT_ROOT` plus that "
"project’s `robot.yaml`). End-effector poses use one of the two frame "
"paths in "
"[robot_action_composer](../../4-reference/python_apps/5-robot_action_composer.md):"
" live TF when `robot.yaml` has no `ee_tip`, or a USD tip→parent chain "
"when `ee_tip` is set."
msgstr ""
"README 里的数采工作区是 lerobot_ros2 内的 **`examples/IsaacSim`**（含 "
"`robots/`）。各机器人说明，包括轮臂 **五纪 W2** 的双臂任务，写在这些目录旁边（例如 "
"[`robots/FiveAges_W2/README.md`](https://github.com/fiveages-"
"sim/lerobot_ros2/blob/main/examples/IsaacSim/robots/FiveAges_W2/README.md"
")）。[fa-project-usd](https://github.com/fiveages-sim/fa-project-usd) "
"的项目目录也可以当工作区（`LEROBOT_ROOT` 加上该项目的 `robot.yaml`）。末端位姿走 "
"[robot_action_composer](../../4-reference/python_apps/5-robot_action_composer.md)"
" 的两条路径之一：`robot.yaml` 没有 `ee_tip` 时用实时 TF；设置了 `ee_tip` 时用 USD 的尖端到父级链。"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/7-synthetic_data/2-orchestration.md:46
#: e9bf6b7301274401be574b0e2d8dc066
msgid "Official Nav2, not a custom nav stack"
msgstr "官方 Nav2，不是自研导航栈"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/7-synthetic_data/2-orchestration.md:48
#: 87289bee57214337a436c44779db8d66
msgid ""
"Composer **does not implement Nav2 servers**. `nav.*` skills wrap "
"**`ROS2RobotInterface`’s Nav2 client API**. Scene-level launch is "
"separate from the task YAML."
msgstr ""
"composer **不实现 Nav2 服务端**。`nav.*` 技能封装的是 **`ROS2RobotInterface` 的 Nav2 "
"客户端 API**。场景级 launch 与任务 YAML 分开。"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/7-synthetic_data/2-orchestration.md:50
#: 1bdc11e254dd426c934c6d3705e83d09
msgid ""
"From [docs/ROS2_STACK.md](https://github.com/fiveages-"
"sim/robot_action_composer/blob/main/docs/ROS2_STACK.md):"
msgstr ""
"摘自 [docs/ROS2_STACK.md](https://github.com/fiveages-"
"sim/robot_action_composer/blob/main/docs/ROS2_STACK.md)："

#: ../../source/2-how_to/7-synthetic_data/2-orchestration.md:52
#: 4d53d1b105df4f2d8a97856932e99404
msgid "Do **not** put `ros2_stack` inside task-queue YAML."
msgstr "**不要**在任务队列 YAML 里写 `ros2_stack`。"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/7-synthetic_data/2-orchestration.md:53
#: 5873678fb792430797f41471bebd4179
msgid "Merge: `robot.yaml` → `ros2_stack:` then leaf **`.meta/ros2_stack.yaml`**."
msgstr "合并：`robot.yaml` → `ros2_stack:`，再叠叶子目录 **`.meta/ros2_stack.yaml`**。"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/7-synthetic_data/2-orchestration.md:54
#: df3ba33d3cbf49f691316e70d7937331
msgid ""
"Motion presets: `ocs2-fullbody` / `ocs2-split-body` / `ocs2-demo` "
"(`ocs2_arm_controller` launches)."
msgstr ""
"运控 preset：`ocs2-fullbody` / `ocs2-split-body` / "
"`ocs2-demo`（`ocs2_arm_controller` 的 launch）。"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/7-synthetic_data/2-orchestration.md:55
#: 3d7c6708abbe47f6b990a257e0874dad
msgid ""
"Navigation: `navigation.profile` `default` or `map_only` expands to "
"**`nav2_profile:=…`**. Default launch: `robot_common_launch` / "
"**`navigation/navigation_isaac_gt.launch.py`** (file exists on that "
"repo’s `main`; see [robot-descriptions-"
"common](../../4-reference/descriptions/2-common.md))."
msgstr ""
"导航：`navigation.profile` 为 `default` 或 `map_only`，展开成 "
"**`nav2_profile:=…`**。默认 launch：`robot_common_launch` / "
"**`navigation/navigation_isaac_gt.launch.py`**（该仓 `main` 上有此文件；见 [robot-"
"descriptions-common](../../4-reference/descriptions/2-common.md)）。"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/7-synthetic_data/2-orchestration.md:56
#: ef59f9168a004a8c995dfb940c9a3c67
msgid ""
"`navigation.required: auto` starts Nav2 only when the `task_queue` "
"contains `nav.*` skills."
msgstr "`navigation.required: auto` 仅当 `task_queue` 含 `nav.*` 技能时才启动 Nav2。"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/7-synthetic_data/2-orchestration.md:58
#: bec1e514cc26411282d81d70747c4de7
msgid ""
"That is the **official Nav2** install/launch already used by the robot "
"workspace, not a fiveages-specific planner."
msgstr "这就是机器人工作区已经在用的**官方 Nav2** 安装/启动方式，不是 FiveAges 自研规划器。"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/7-synthetic_data/2-orchestration.md:60
#: ed50af2e01234534bc414c3c7f7ddfe8
msgid "CLIs (after `./init.sh`)"
msgstr "CLI（跑完 `./init.sh` 之后）"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/7-synthetic_data/2-orchestration.md:62
#: c5cbbb0cb2844a288c7667bb91ce4ba3
msgid ""
"Console scripts from composer `pyproject.toml`: `motion-generation`, "
"`ros2-stack`, `grasp-generation`, `check-isaac-pose`, `check-robot-"
"status`."
msgstr ""
"composer `pyproject.toml` 中的 console scripts：`motion-"
"generation`、`ros2-stack`、`grasp-generation`、`check-isaac-pose`、`check-"
"robot-status`。"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/7-synthetic_data/2-orchestration.md:64
#: 6273e76cf3aa4c3a97366e155723a1a6
msgid ""
"Run from a directory that contains `robots/` (usually "
"`examples/IsaacSim`):"
msgstr "在包含 `robots/` 的目录下运行（通常是 `examples/IsaacSim`）："

#: ../../source/2-how_to/7-synthetic_data/2-orchestration.md:66
#: b6afc349e8d74b43a8da8b59ef5745c9
msgid ""
"cd examples/IsaacSim\n"
"\n"
"# Scene-level OCS2 + Nav2 (background logs under .ros2_stack/<robot>/)\n"
"ros2-stack launch --robot fiveages_w2 --group dex_hand\n"
"ros2-stack status --robot fiveages_w2\n"
"ros2-stack stop --robot fiveages_w2\n"
"\n"
"# Task queue (dry motion; optional --ensure-ros2-stack)\n"
"motion-generation\n"
"motion-generation --robot fiveages_w2 --task-key navigate_and_dex_grasp "
"--scene apple\n"
"motion-generation --robot fiveages_w2 --task-key transfer_blade --ensure-"
"ros2-stack"
msgstr ""
"cd examples/IsaacSim\n"
"\n"
"# Scene-level OCS2 + Nav2 (background logs under .ros2_stack/<robot>/)\n"
"ros2-stack launch --robot fiveages_w2 --group dex_hand\n"
"ros2-stack status --robot fiveages_w2\n"
"ros2-stack stop --robot fiveages_w2\n"
"\n"
"# Task queue (dry motion; optional --ensure-ros2-stack)\n"
"motion-generation\n"
"motion-generation --robot fiveages_w2 --task-key navigate_and_dex_grasp "
"--scene apple\n"
"motion-generation --robot fiveages_w2 --task-key transfer_blade --ensure-"
"ros2-stack"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/7-synthetic_data/2-orchestration.md:80
#: 8256debaa9df4815a7c059b38a37440d
msgid ""
"`grasp-generation serve …` is an optional grasp-setup UI "
"([GRASP_GENERATION.md](https://github.com/fiveages-"
"sim/robot_action_composer/blob/main/docs/GRASP_GENERATION.md)); it is "
"**not** the recording entry and is **not** ros2-viser. The same step "
"inside a task queue is the skill `dex_hand.auto_grasp`."
msgstr ""
"`grasp-generation serve …` "
"是可选的抓取调试界面（[GRASP_GENERATION.md](https://github.com/fiveages-"
"sim/robot_action_composer/blob/main/docs/GRASP_GENERATION.md)）。它不是录制入口，也不是"
" ros2-viser。任务队列里的同一步是技能 `dex_hand.auto_grasp`。"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/7-synthetic_data/2-orchestration.md:82
#: 980fae98e71547bfbd2753677e428a92
msgid ""
"Isaac entity pose / joint dump helpers (`check-isaac-pose`, `check-robot-"
"status`) need the sim and `/get_entity_state` as documented in the "
"composer README."
msgstr ""
"Isaac 实体位姿 / 关节转储助手（`check-isaac-pose`、`check-robot-status`）需要仿真以及 "
"composer README 所写的 `/get_entity_state`。"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/7-synthetic_data/2-orchestration.md:84
#: 381d67d00ec945f989ed807087589e81
msgid ""
